support='''<section class="wrap hero"><div class="hero-grid"><div><div class="eyebrow">IT support / The gr3y family</div><h1>Technology<br>should make<br><em>your day easier.</em></h1><p class="lede">When it doesn’t, a clear next step makes all the difference. gr3y.io is the IT support side of the gr3y family.</p>'''+button('Find your starting point','#support')+'''</div><div class="art io-art" role="img" aria-label="Connected devices around a central IT support hub"><span class="art-top">PEOPLE AT THE CENTRE / TECHNOLOGY CONNECTED</span><div class="network" aria-hidden="true"><div class="node center">gr3y.io</div><div class="node n1"><span>⌘</span><small>Devices</small></div><div class="node n2"><span>◎</span><small>Networks</small></div><div class="node n3"><span>▤</span><small>Software</small></div><div class="node n4"><span>↗</span><small>People</small></div></div><span class="art-label">Less friction. More getting on with it.</span></div></div></section><div class="wrap caption"><span>Clear explanations. Practical next steps.</span><span>IT / People / Everyday work</span></div><section class="wrap section" id="support"><div class="eyebrow">01 / Where to start</div><div class="section-head"><h2>Let’s make the<br>problem clearer.</h2><p>IT issues rarely arrive with a neat explanation. Start with what you’re seeing, what’s changed, and what you need to get back to.</p></div><div class="rows"><div class="row"><span class="number">01</span><h3>Devices & software</h3><p>A computer behaving differently, an application getting in the way, or a setup that needs attention. Describe what happens and when.</p><span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></div><div class="row"><span class="number">02</span><h3>Connections & access</h3><p>Trouble getting connected or reaching the tools you use? Note which devices are affected and any messages you see.</p><span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></div><div class="row"><span class="number">03</span><h3>Everyday IT questions</h3><p>Sometimes you need a second perspective before making a change. Start with the outcome you want and the tools you already have.</p><span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></div></div></section><section class="wrap section" id="approach"><div class="eyebrow">02 / The approach</div><div class="section-head"><h2>A little structure.<br>A lot less guesswork.</h2><p>Our approach to support is straightforward: understand the issue, explain the options, and work toward a practical next step.</p></div><div class="notes"><article class="lab-note"><span class="number">01 / UNDERSTAND</span><h3>Start by listening.</h3><p>What’s happening, who it affects, and what you’ve tried. Context comes before a fix.</p></article><article class="lab-note"><span class="number">02 / EXPLAIN</span><h3>Keep it clear.</h3><p>Plain language helps you understand the problem and make an informed decision about what comes next.</p></article><article class="lab-note"><span class="number">03 / MOVE FORWARD</span><h3>Focus on the next step.</h3><p>A useful resolution starts with a sensible action and a clear explanation of what to expect.</p></article></div></section><section class="wrap section" id="questions"><div class="eyebrow">03 / Before you begin</div><div class="section-head"><h2>A few useful answers.</h2></div><details><summary>What information should I have ready?</summary><p>Your device and operating system, the application involved, the exact error message, and when the problem started. A screenshot can help; remove passwords and personal information first.</p></details><details><summary>Should I share a password?</summary><p>No. Keep passwords, recovery codes, and other account secrets private. Explain the access problem without including credentials.</p></details><details><summary>How does gr3y.io fit into the company?</summary><p>gr3y.io focuses on IT support. gr3ylabs is the software and experimentation branch, and gr3ycapital is the parent company with a focus on finance and financial applications.</p></details><details><summary>Where can I explore your IT tools?</summary><p>Visit <a href="https://github.com/gr3ysbot-tech/Gr3y-Tools" style="text-decoration:underline">Gr3y Tools on GitHub</a> for one-line PowerShell utilities for field IT work. Review each tool’s instructions before running it.</p></details></section><section class="wrap section"><div class="cta"><h2>Practical tools.<br>From the same family.</h2>'''+button('Explore Gr3y Tools','https://github.com/gr3ysbot-tech/Gr3y-Tools')+'''</div></section>'''
